(text "LDO - LT3080  |  Analog Devices  |  36V 1.1A single-resistor LDO, SOT-223" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 14.00 0) (effects (font (size 2.2 2.2) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8c84240e-9d2f-4f0d-97fe-1584cbb3e6fd"))
(text "Default build: VOUT = 1.8 V (fixed resistors - no trimmer). Pin-compatible family: pin1 ADJ/SET, pin2 + tab OUT, pin3 IN.\nOther outputs: change only the programming resistor(s) per the VOUT table." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 19.30 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f1a30c68-622f-43d6-b5ca-b994c07c753e"))
(text "DESIGN EQUATIONS - LT3080 (ADI LT3080 datasheet Rev.E)\nDesign point: VOUT 1.8 V (default), VIN 5.0 V nominal (3.3 V rail also checked), IOUT rated 1.1 A, SOT-223 (ST, 3-lead)\nOutput: VOUT = ISET * RSET, ISET = 10 uA (+/-1% at 25C, +/-2% over temp) - single resistor, no divider\n  RSET = VOUT/10uA = 180.0k -> 180k ; VOUT = 1.800 V ; use 0.1%-1% low-TC resistor (VOUT tracks RSET)\n  Min load 1.0 mA max (0.5 mA typ): RMIN = VOUT/1mA = 1.8k bleeder fitted (DNP if load always > 1 mA)\n  CSET 0.1uF across RSET lowers output noise (40 uVrms) and adds a soft-start; tau = RSET*CSET = 18 ms\nDropout: VDO = 1.6 V max @ 1.1 A (SOT-223: VCONTROL tied to IN) -> VIN(min) = VOUT + VDO = 3.40 V at full load\n  3.3 V rail: headroom 1.50 V vs VDO 1.6 V -> NOT OK at full load (use 5 V input) ; 5 V rail: headroom 3.20 V -> OK\nCurrent limit: 1.1 A min / 1.4 A typ ; VIN(max) = 36 V\nCapacitors: Stable with >= 2.2 uF ceramic on OUT (ESR not required).\n  Footprint-compatible with the 1117 parts, BUT programmed by one SET resistor (RSET = VOUT/10uA).\nTHERMAL (thetaJA = 55 C/W, ST package, datasheet Table 4 range 23-55; TJ(max) 125 C)\n  VIN 5.0 V: efficiency = VOUT*IOUT/(VIN*(IOUT+Idiv)) = 36% (max VOUT/VIN = 36%) ; temp rise dT = thetaJA*PD = 194 C\n  VIN 5.0 V: PD = (VIN-VOUT)*IOUT = 3.20*1.1 = 3.52 W -> TJ = 219C @25C / 279C @85C ; thermal IOUT(max) = 0.43 A @TA50C, 0.23 A @TA85C\n  VIN 3.3 V: efficiency = VOUT*IOUT/(VIN*(IOUT+Idiv)) = 54% (max VOUT/VIN = 55%) ; temp rise dT = thetaJA*PD = 91 C\n  VIN 3.3 V: PD = (VIN-VOUT)*IOUT = 1.50*1.1 = 1.65 W -> TJ = 116C @25C / 176C @85C ; thermal IOUT(max) = 0.91 A @TA50C, 0.48 A @TA85C\n  PD(max) = (125 - TA)/thetaJA = 1.36 W @50C, 0.73 W @85C. Add copper / heatsink or pre-regulate to raise current." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 130.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3d810883-8ae2-41ec-9c21-999ad884bd4b"))
